id=sfwm-sfhook
name=sfwm SurfaceFlinger hook (optional)
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=sfwm
description=OPTIONAL. Lets sfwm hand a client dma-buf to SurfaceFlinger for scanout without compositing it. Not needed for sfwm to run; only try it if you want to remove the last composite step. Experimental, may restart the system UI.
